<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back on-market at NZ$7.09-20.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back on-market at NZ$7.09-20.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Tuesday it had bought back 1,182,550 shares on-market during the session at prices ranging from NZ$7.09 to $7.20, pursuant to its NZ$1 billion share buyback programme.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
